msgstr "Il symbol rate usato sul mux/transponder."

#: src/input/mpegts/mpegts_mux_dvb.c:656 src/input/mpegts/mpegts_mux_dvb.c:884
msgid "The symbol rate."
msgstr "Il symbol rate."

#: src/imagecache.c:109
msgid ""
"The time in days after the cached URL will be removed. The time starts when "
"the URL was lastly requested. Zero means unlimited cache (not recommended)."
msgstr ""
"Il tempo in giorni dopo cui l'URL nella cache viene rimosso, a partire "
"dall'ultima richiesta dell'URL. Zero significa cache illimitata "
"(sconsigliato)."

#: src/dvr/dvr_db.c:4585
msgid "The time the entry stops/stopped being recorded."
msgstr "L'orario in cui la registrazione della voce termina/è terminata."

#: src/config.c:2491
msgid ""
"The time window to cut the stop time from the overlapped event in seconds."
